%% @kicker Where the loop breaks
%% @alt The agent loop drawn as a ring of perceive, think, act, and remember, with two failure points marked. At act, a tool call times out, the agent retries, and the action executes twice. At perceive, context pollution lets one agent's scratch work leak into another's prompt.
